    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the everyday passenger to the horrors of Halloween, Spirit Driver is a short, casual conversation visual novel where your choices can affect the fates of people and spirits alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an old taxi driver nearing retirement, you'll be spending your time working the &quot;special shift&quot; during the week of Halloween. During this special shift, your passengers will consist of both people and supernatural beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally made for the 2024 Spooktober 6th Annual Visual Novel Jam, Spirit Driver is releasing on Steam with a few changes from the original, including achievements, cafe changes, and minor tweaks. The main story remains the same. This version is mainly for those who wish to support us and/or get achievements on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ Characters to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1 hour of gameplay (Highly dependent on choices made and reading speed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings for each situation depending on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In house menu, cafe, upstairs, and fight music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various CC0-CC4.0 Assets, Music, and SFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random assortment of references to other media</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added various achievements to get throughout the game</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the everyday passenger to the horrors of Halloween, Spirit Driver is a short, casual conversation visual novel where your choices can affect the fates of people and spirits alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an old taxi driver nearing retirement, you'll be spending your time working the &quot;special shift&quot; during the week of Halloween. During this special shift, your passengers will consist of both people and supernatural beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally made for the 2024 Spooktober 6th Annual Visual Novel Jam, Spirit Driver is releasing on Steam with a few changes from the original, including achievements, cafe changes, and minor tweaks. The main story remains the same. This version is mainly for those who wish to support us and/or get achievements on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ Characters to interact with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 1 hour of gameplay (Highly dependent on choices made and reading speed)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings for each situation depending on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In house menu, cafe, upstairs, and fight music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various CC0-CC4.0 Assets, Music, and SFX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random assortment of references to other media</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added various achievements to get throughout the game</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "From the everyday passenger to the horrors of Halloween, Spirit Driver is a short, casual conversation visual novel where your choices can affect the fates of people and spirits alike. Remember, your choices have consequences. Good luck!",
